    "Project B": {
      "clarity of value proposition": "• Very clear – addresses a common pain point (difficulty in donating effectively and knowing the impact of donations). The focus on transparency and user experience is strong.",
      "market size and demand": "• Large and accessible market – many people want to donate but are hesitant. The ease of use is a key selling point.",
      "feasibility and development plan": "• Shows a high degree of readiness – the platform is built, nonprofits are vetted, and the mission is defined. Launching is imminent.",
      "revenue model and sustainability": "• Sustainable through transaction fees. The focus on user trust and retention is crucial.",
      "differentiation": "• Differentiation comes primarily from the focus on transparency, impact reporting, and user privacy. The curated nonprofit list is also a differentiator.",
      "impact and evidence plan": "• Strong evidence plan – proposing specific tests (conversion rates, retention, privacy opt-in) to validate key claims. The planned partnership with the Food Bank provides a concrete example.",
